{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1426451-what\u2019s-a-goblin-road","id":1426451,"title":"What\u2019s a Goblin Road?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-11-28T05:02:43-08:00","id":1426451,"title":"What\u2019s a Goblin Road?","content":"Just read Dying Fields and I\u2019m a little confused.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a> you\u2019re really good at Vampire but definitely anybody can answer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-11-28T10:02:15-08:00","id":1426476,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1426451-what\u2019s-a-goblin-road#post1426451\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Just read Dying Fields and I\u2019m a little confused.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar12002_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"12002\" data-vbnamecard=\"12002\">CTPhipps</a> you\u2019re really good at Vampire but definitely anybody can answer.</div> </div> </div> </div>Why thank you.<br /> <br /> The Goblin Roads are a holdover from Beckett's Jyhad Diary but can best be described as a weird supernatural effect around the roads in Milwaukee to Chicago as well as some other places inbetween. For supernaturals, not regular people, WEIRD things happen and it is incredibly hazardous to travel by car. Basically, trips take longer. You find yourself meeting weird murderous hitchhikers with supernatural powers. You go places you aren't driving. Oh and werewolves. The Dying Fields has you enter a town you simply can't leave. It's all very Twilight Zone and meant to reflect American mythology about haunted highways.<br /> <br /> I did a story called The Waukegan Way (starring a disguised Arthur Caldwell) about a &quot;Goblin Driver&quot; who gets ambushed by a group of Black Spiral Dancers and Sabbat for the Darkened Roads book.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/294150/Darkened-Streets?fbclid=IwAR07ajwRSU1ih6RoP-L9jN1PfOmNomt95acnMmDYGJXBe4x1V8A1I-tO-SI\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.storytellersvault.com/pr...4x1V8A1I-tO-SI</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/